:: Street Police Sergeant Widgets [widget]

<<widget "eventPoliceSergeant">>
	<<generatePoliceSergeant>><<generatePolice 2>>
	<<person1>>
	<<if $policeSergeantIntro is undefined>>
		<<set $policeSergeantIntro to 1>>
		<span class="purple">You hear a police siren for a second.</span> 
		<br><br>
		You look around to find the source of it, and spot a police cab parked right at the other side of the street. A tall well-built <<person1>><<person>> gets off the cab, followed by a <<person2>><<person>> who seems to be their partner.
		<br><br>

		"Oi, you little bitch! Come over 'ere, quickly!" says the <<person1>><<person>>. And not seeing any other way around it, you comply.
		<br><br>
		
		The <<person>> closes the remaining distance and instantly surrounds you with their arm, showcasing familiarity. 
		"See what I was telling you about? This little piece of shit delinquent is my <<print ($player.sex is "f"? "stepdaughter" : "stepson")>>," <<he>> tells the <<person2>><<person>>. "Yeah, I can totally see what you meant, <<police_sergeant>>," <<he>> responds.
		<br><br>
		
		"It's rare finding you here, Whitney. You sneaky little bitch. Are you hiding from me during the day? 'You fucking scared of something?" <<police_sergeant>> berates. "You better not be hiding from me. I swear I'll beat your ass if you are to show you some manners," <<person1>><<he>> tightens <<his>> arm around your neck in a mock lock before releasing you with a shove.
		<br><br>

		"Today you're off the hook, little bitch. Consider yourself lucky," <<he>> grins. "Dispatch sent a report of another fucking rape."<br><br>

		And with that, <<police_sergeant>> gets in the car with <<his>> partner, starts the engine, and turns the wheel back into the street. But before <<he>> is off, you hear <<him>> mutter under his breath, "Ha! Can't deal with a little rape... This town is filled with cunts."
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		<span class="purple">You hear a police siren for a second.</span>
		<br><br>
		"Oi, you ungrateful little bitch! Come 'ere greet your <<print ($per_npc.pronoun is "f"? "mama" : "ol' man")>>." It's <<police_sergeant>>. Whitney's <<print ($per_npc.pronoun is "f"? "stepmom" : "stepdad")>>.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Comply|Police Sergeant Chase]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<sub 1>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Run Away|Police Sergeant Chase]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<def 1>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 200 1200>>
	<</if>>
	<<endevent>>
	<<destinationeventend>>
<</widget>>

:: Police Sergeant Chase

